note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-mrow.om: mrow (gpu/nvidia/om/codegen/cg_mrow.om), as packing() of CUDApp
note tests/api_rest_diff.c calls it. Q m, n, np; s[i] = (float)i; output 0 the digest of the m * n copied bit
note patterns. Composed before arestg.om.
text t_name "AREST-MROW"
text t_mrow "mrow"
fn arop q view ulong 256 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 256 to ulong
if or ne nq 3 not ckis 0 t_mrow
ckbad
end
sn = mul get q 0 get q 2
dn = mul get q 0 get q 1
if or gt sn 408 gt dn 289
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 3 0
for i ulong 3
put a i get q i
end
s = new f32 408 0.0f32
for i ulong 408
put s i f32 i
end
d = new f32 289 -1.0f32
r = mrow a part s 0 sn part d 0 dn
h = ardg0
for i ulong dn bound 289
h = ardg h ulong bitcast uint get d i
end
put o 0 h
ret bitcast ulong r
end
